  "body": "Designed for easy, low-maintenance living close to the heart of Mairangi Bay.\r\n\r\n• Approx. 218sqm of generous living\r\n\r\n• Private lift - easy access between levels\r\n\r\n• Double internal-access garage\r\n\r\n• Quality Gaggenau kitchen appliances\r\n\r\n• Heat pumps & smart home features\r\n\r\n• Private outdoor living\r\n\r\n• Professionally managed body corporate\r\n\r\nWalk to Mairangi Bay Beach, cafés, restaurants and the village, or simply lock up and head away.\r\n\r\nMore freedom. Less maintenance. A great place to come home to.",
